      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Whenever you arrange objects where order matters and all objects are
        used, you will use Factorial.\n\nArranging 4 people in a row:\n\nFirst position
        you have 4 choices\n\nSecond position you have 3 choices\n\nThird position
        you have 2 choices\n\nLast position you have 1 choices\n\nUsing the Fundamental
        Principle of Counting,\nwe multiply the number of choices at each step:\n\nTotal
        arrangements:\n\n4 \xD7 3 \xD7 2 \xD7 1 = 24\n"
